<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>HTML5 & CSS3 Quick Cheatsheet - SmartLearn PDF</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #f8f9fa; color: #212529; padding: 40px; }
    .pdf-card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 40px; max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .header-bar { border-bottom: 3px solid #198754; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .formula-box { background: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #198754; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 15px 0; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 1rem; }
    @media print {
      body { background: white; padding: 0; }
      .pdf-card { box-shadow: none; max-width: 100%; padding: 20px; }
      .no-print { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="pdf-card">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center no-print mb-4">
      <a href="/notes.html" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to SmartLearn Library</a>
      <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn btn-success fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-print"></i> Save / Print as PDF</button>
    </div>

    <div class="header-bar d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-success mb-1">🌐 HTML5 & CSS3 Quick Cheatsheet</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">SmartLearn Official Study Guide • Web Development Series</p>
      </div>
      <span class="badge bg-success fs-6 px-3 py-2">Programming</span>
    </div>

    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">1. Semantic HTML5 Elements</h4>
    <div class="formula-box">
      • &lt;header&gt; : Top header section (logo, nav)<br>
      • &lt;nav&gt; : Main navigation links<br>
      • &lt;main&gt; : Primary content container<br>
      • &lt;article&gt; : Self-contained content post<br>
      • &lt;section&gt; : Thematic grouping of content<br>
      • &lt;aside&gt; : Sidebar content area<br>
      • &lt;footer&gt; : Bottom copyright & links section
    </div>

    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">2. CSS Flexbox Layout Essentials</h4>
    <div class="formula-box">
      .container {<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;display: flex;<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;flex-direction: row | column;<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;justify-content: center | space-between | flex-start;<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;align-items: center | stretch;<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;gap: 20px;<br>
      }
    </div>

    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">3. CSS Grid Responsive Layout</h4>
    <div class="formula-box">
      .grid-container {<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;display: grid;<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;gap: 24px;<br>
      }
    </div>

    <hr class="my-5">
    <div class="text-center text-muted small">
      <p>© 2026 SmartLearn Library — Verified Academic Study Resource 🎓</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
